{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sync-monitoring-debugging","title":"同步监控与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/sync-monitoring-debugging","wordCount":1296,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"bandwidth-battery-optimization","title":"带宽与电量优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/bandwidth-battery-optimization","wordCount":1402,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-migration-versioning","title":"数据迁移与版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/data-migration-versioning","wordCount":1300,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"运维篇\">运维篇</h1><p>离线同步系统上线后，真正的挑战才开始。同步失败是沉默的——用户不会立即感知数据丢失，直到某天发现历史编辑消失。本章覆盖生产环境中同步系统的三大运维支柱：可观测性（监控与调试）、资源效率（带宽与电量）、以及长期演进能力（数据迁移与版本管理）。</p>\n<p>三篇文档从「看得见问题」、「用得起资源」、「演进得动 schema」三个维度，确保离线同步系统在生产环境中持续健康运行。</p>\n"}